{"data":{"id":"aBeUO7hH3BE","slug":"seven-davis-jr","title":"Seven Davis Jr.","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"LpEiTWe2UgY","slug":"one","title":"One"}]},"markers":[{"id":"9Zj2wHzYO54","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Seven Davis Jr. - One","track":{"id":"LpEiTWe2UgY","path":"/artists/seven-davis-jr/tracks/one/","slug":"one","title":"One","artist":{"slug":"seven-davis-jr","title":"Seven Davis Jr."},"artwork":"images/artists/seven-davis-jr/tracks/one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mT0b7zueZhI","slug":"138","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-138-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #138 w/ Great Dane","artwork":"/images/episodes/138.jpg","content":"\nProducer Great Dane (co-founder of Team Supreme) delivers energy and bass\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nFor this show we had the young and progressive producer Great Dane who is the co-founder of one of the best collectives in LA (Team Supreme) and an artist on Alpha Pup. Joe Kay kicked things off for the first hour & 28 minutes of exclusive material ranging from Mr. Carmack, Kaytranada, Sango, Jo Def, Esta, and many others. Great Dane truly understands our memo when we say, 'NO TIME FOR FILLER TRACKS'. As soon as he hit play constant energy and bass started flowing. He played an exclusive 45 minute set which consisted of all original productions except for two tracks. This won't be the last time you hear from him.\n \n\n\n\n Thanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"0rAthrcnV0o","position":49,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Seven Davis Jr - One","track":{"id":"LpEiTWe2UgY","path":"/artists/seven-davis-jr/tracks/one/","slug":"one","title":"One","artist":{"slug":"seven-davis-jr","title":"Seven Davis Jr."},"artwork":"images/artists/seven-davis-jr/trac